''Table instinct:'' Aki prepares the battlefield before battle claims the scene.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/visual-registers>>

!! Visual Registers

!!! 1. True Body — Spider Folk

Iridescent fae chitin. Extra arms. Soft alien face. Chitin plates. Web-silk organs. Sacred, fae, and strange rather than monstrous.

!!! 2. Public Glamour — Traveling Miko

Red and white shrine workwear. Silksteel ritual robe layers. Wide-brimmed ''ichimegasa'' with ''uchikatsugi-style veil''. Shrine bells, ofuda, spinneret tools, and soft faerie glamour.

The glamour softens Aki's chitinous body for social passage. It does not erase her true form. Treat it as visual and social positioning until a Power, item, or roll grants stronger mechanics.

!!! 3. Threshold Reveal — Glamour Thins

The veil lifts. Extra arms appear. Chitin catches moonlight. Silk lines, ward papers, bells, and shrine geometry mark the room. Ichi may step in as armor or shield.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/stats>>

!! Ability Scores

| STR | AGI | END | THT | CHA | AUR |
|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| 0 | 1 | 1 | 3 | 2 | 2 |

''Reading:'' Thought and Aura drive DreamNet contact, wizardry, ritual analysis, glamour, and shrine work. Agility and Endurance keep Aki mobile enough for field pressure. Strength does not carry the build.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/heritage>>

!! Heritage — Spider Folk

''Rank:'' Skilled (+3)  
''Effects:'' Affinity — Silk & Web; Alternate Movement — Climb; Armoured Body

!!! Affinity — Silk & Web

Tags: `[illusion] [silk] [web]`

Aki spins lines, sheets, snares, glamour scaffolds, ward webs, belay systems, ritual knots, and silk-field diagrams from web-silk.

Use this for:
* silk and web craft,
* vibration reading,
* shrine-thread omens,
* ambush geometry,
* fae-spider etiquette,
* illusion staging,
* alchemical binding.

!!! Alternate Movement — Climb

Aki climbs at normal Speed.

After 30 minutes of continuous climbing, mark Heritage and make a Wear and Tear attrition save. While marked, make another attrition save every 10 minutes of continued alternate movement.

!!! Armoured Body

Aki's true chitin grants ''+1 Armor'' and ''+1 Ward''. This comes from her body, not worn gear.

This stacks with Ichi when worn, because Heritage Armoured Body comes from the operator's form rather than equipment.

<<~/ahu>>

